"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":[\"TattooParlor\",\"LocalBusiness\"],\"@id\":\"https://bleedinginktattoo.com#business\",\"name\":\"Bleeding Ink Tattooing\",\"alternateName\":\"Bleeding Ink\",\"description\":\"Custom tattoo studio in Johnstown, PA. Coverups, color work, walk-ins welcome. Located in the Johnstown Galleria. Free consultation, $65 deposit.\",\"url\":\"https://bleedinginktattoo.com\",\"telephone\":\"(215) 980-1386\",\"image\":\"https://bleedinginktattoo.com/og-default.svg\",\"logo\":\"https://bleedinginktattoo.com/icons/logo.png\",\"priceRange\":\"$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"500 Galleria Dr\",\"addressLocality\":\"Johnstown\",\"addressRegion\":\"PA\",\"postalCode\":\"15904\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"},\"openingHoursSpecification\":[{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":\"Tuesday\",\"opens\":\"11:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"},{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":\"Wednesday\",\"opens\":\"11:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"},{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":\"Thursday\",\"opens\":\"11:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"},{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":\"Friday\",\"opens\":\"11:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"},{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":\"Saturday\",\"opens\":\"11:00\",\"closes\":\"19:00\"}],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/BleedingInkTattooing/\",\"https://www.instagram.com/ibleedink_600/\",\"https://www.threads.net/@ibleedink_600\"],\"founder\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Isiah Jackson\"}}</script><a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a><header style=\"position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;background:transparent;transition:background 0.2s ease;border-bottom:none\"><nav style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#F5F1E8;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap\" href=\"/\">Bleeding <span style=\"color:#8B0000\">Ink</span></a><div class=\"desktop-nav\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px\"><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/artists\">Artists</a><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/portfolio\">Portfolio</a><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"nav-link\" style=\"opacity:0.85;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding-bottom:4px\" href=\"/book\">Book</a></div><a href=\"tel:+12159801386\" class=\"desktop-cta\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 18px;background:#8B0000;color:#F5F1E8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;border:2px solid #8B0000;transition:background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease\" aria-label=\"Call Bleeding Ink\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📞</span><span>(215) 980-1386</span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:44px;background:transparent;border:2px solid #F5F1E8;color:#F5F1E8;cursor:pointer;padding:0\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></nav></header><main id=\"main\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><section style=\"position:relative;min-height:92vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#F5F1E8;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.18) 0%, #0A0A0A 70%);background-size:cover;background-position:center;padding:120px 24px 60px;overflow:hidden\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 48\" style=\"position:absolute;top:16px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:28px;height:42px;fill:#8B0000;opacity:0.6\"><path d=\"M16 0 C16 0 32 18 32 30 C32 40 24 48 16 48 C8 48 0 40 0 30 C0 18 16 0 16 0 Z\"></path></svg><div style=\"max-width:980px;width:100%\"><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(56px, 12vw, 140px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:0.92;margin:0;color:#F5F1E8\"><span>Bleeding<!-- --> </span><span>Ink</span></h1><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);font-size:26px;margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:36px;opacity:0.9;letter-spacing:0.01em;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">Custom tattoos, coverups, color work. Johnstown&#x27;s shop since the rebrand. Walk-ins welcome, free consultation.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:center\"><a class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:16px;padding:16px 32px\" href=\"/book\">Book a Session</a><a class=\"btn-secondary\" style=\"font-size:16px;padding:16px 32px;color:#F5F1E8;border-color:#F5F1E8\" href=\"/portfolio\">See Our Work</a></div></div></section><section style=\"padding:80px 24px\"><div style=\"max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center\"><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);font-size:24px;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:24px\">Appointments preferred, walk-ins always welcome.</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;opacity:0.85\">Custom pieces, coverups, and color work from a small team in the Johnstown Galleria. Walk in for a free consultation, or book ahead for custom work.<!-- --> <strong style=\"color:#8B0000\">$65<!-- --> non-refundable deposit</strong> secures your slot.</p></div></section><section style=\"background:#F5F1E8;color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:80px 24px\"><div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;margin-bottom:48px\"><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">The Team</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Artists</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:20px;opacity:0.85\">Two artists, two distinct styles. Pick the one that fits your idea, or come in for a free consultation and we&#x27;ll match you.</p></div><a style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/artists\">See all artists →</a></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:32px\"><a style=\"display:block;background:#F5F1E8;color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.1)\" href=\"/artists/isiah-jackson\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);color:#8B0000;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:0.02em\">Owner · Lead Artist</div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:32px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1\">Isiah Jackson</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:0.85\">Owner and lead artist at Bleeding Ink. Custom pieces, coverups, and color work are the focus. Approach is hands-on with every client — bring your idea, leave with ink you actually want to live with.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #8B0000;color:#8B0000\">Custom</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #8B0000;color:#8B0000\">Coverups</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #8B0000;color:#8B0000\">Color</span></div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000\">View profile →</div></a><a style=\"display:block;background:#F5F1E8;color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.1)\" href=\"/artists/courtney-fetzer\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);color:#8B0000;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:0.02em\">Artist</div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:32px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1\">Courtney Fetzer</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:0.85\">Joining the team in June 2026. Working her way through the craft and growing into her style. Single mom, tattooist, makeup fiend — and a pleasure to sit with.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #8B0000;color:#8B0000\">Apprentice</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid #8B0000;color:#8B0000\">Custom</span></div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000\">View profile →</div></a></div></div></section><section style=\"padding:80px 24px\"><div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;margin-bottom:48px\"><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">What We Do</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Services</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:20px;opacity:0.85\">Custom work, coverups, color. Every piece starts with a conversation.</p></div><a style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/services\">See all services →</a></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));gap:24px\"><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.08)\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0;line-height:1\">Custom Tattoos</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;opacity:0.85\">Every custom tattoo starts with a free consultation. We&#x27;ll talk through placement, size, style, and budget, then sketch and refine before any ink goes down. Most custom work needs 2-4 hours per session.</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto\"><a style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/contact\">Get a quote →</a></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.08)\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0;line-height:1\">Coverups</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;opacity:0.85\">Coverups require a careful eye — color, density, and placement all matter. Some coverups can be done in one session; others need a laser pre-treatment to lighten the old ink first. Consultation is free; we&#x27;ll tell you upfront what&#x27;s realistic.</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto\"><a style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/contact\">Get a quote →</a></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.08)\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0;line-height:1\">Color Work</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;opacity:0.85\">Saturated, long-lasting color. We work in a range of palettes — saturated full-color pieces, soft pastels, traditional Americana — whatever fits the design.</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto\"><a style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/contact\">Get a quote →</a></div></div></div></div></section><section style=\"background:#8B0000;color:#F5F1E8;padding:60px 24px;text-align:center\"><div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:0.95\">Ready to get inked?</h2><p style=\"font-size:18px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;opacity:0.95\">Book a session or stop by for a free walk-in consultation. We&#x27;re inside the Johnstown Galleria.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 32px;background:#F5F1E8;color:#8B0000;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.02em\" href=\"/book\">Book a Session</a><a style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 32px;background:transparent;color:#F5F1E8;border:2px solid #F5F1E8;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.02em\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a></div></div></section><section style=\"background:#F5F1E8;color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:80px 24px\"><div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:48px;align-items:start\"><div><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">Find Us</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Visit the Shop</h2></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.8\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">Johnstown Galleria</div><div>500 Galleria Dr</div><div>Johnstown<!-- -->, <!-- -->PA<!-- --> <!-- -->15904</div><div style=\"margin-top:16px;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#8B0000\">(215) 980-1386</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=500%20Galleria%20Dr%2C%20Johnstown%2C%20PA%2015904\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"font-size:14px\">Get Directions</a></div></div><div><iframe src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=500%20Galleria%20Dr%2C%20Johnstown%2C%20PA%2015904&amp;t=&amp;z=15&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;iwloc=&amp;o